// "Mill(who)" ([CR#701.17a]) — the bare-verb pattern TWIN: "whenever `who`
// mills". Expands to the `Act` master form, the performer riding `who` (the
// fact's `actor`). The `Dies`/`Destroyed` precedent.
(
    name: "Mill",
    template: "${0} mills",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate],
    body: Act(verb: Mill, who: Param(0)),
)
